<title>USA: GOLF-THURSDAY'S RESULTS FROM HOUSTON OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-THURSDAY'S RESULTS FROM HOUSTON OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>Houston Open golf tournament on Thursday (players U.S. unless</p>
<p>noted):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>65 David Duval</p>
<p>67 Curtis Strange</p>
<p>68 Phil Blackmar, Kevin Sutherland, Grant Waite (Australia)</p>
<p>Hal Sutton, John Morse</p>
<p>69 Fred Couples, Steve Elkington (Australia), Fred Funk, Lorn</p>
<p>Roberts, David Ogrin, David Berganio, Mark Brooks</p>
<p>70 Jerry Kelly, Willie Wood</p>
<p>71 Craig Parry (Australia), Vijay Singh (Fiju), Lennie</p>
<p>Clements, Lee Rinker, David Edwards, Brian Henninger, Jay</p>
<p>Haas, Robin Freeman, Skip Kendell, Tom Kite, Neal Lancaster,</p>
<p>Justin Leonard</p>
<p>Add regional scores:</p>
<p>72 Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand)</p>
<p>75 Fulton Allem (South Africa)</p>
<p>76 Hisayuki Sasaki (Japan), Rafael Alarcon (Mexico), Gabriel</p>
<p>Hjertstedt (Sweden)</p>
<p>79 Hideki Kase (Japan), Joe Ozaki (Japan)</p>
</text>
